    "detailed_description": "Dream Runner is a time survival game with minimalistic gameplay and roguelite elements. You wake up in a dream world where your memories are vanishing by the second and your main goal is to save as many memories as you can before they vanish forever. All you can do is survive as long as you can before the world inevitably crumbles and you wake up. As you collect memory shards, you level up and on every level up you can get upgrades and bonuses that can completely change your strategy.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776720/extras/0fc2921f80088b040ddaa2c82809b97e.poster.avif?t=1730899303\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776720/extras/0fc2921f80088b040ddaa2c82809b97e.webm?t=1730899303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776720/extras/0fc2921f80088b040ddaa2c82809b97e.mp4?t=1730899303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><u>KEY FEATURES</u></strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Walk, Run, Jump, Dash and other abilities<br></li><li> Combine dozens of different upgrades to create your own strategy<br></li><li> Evade monsters and obstacles<br></li><li> Share and compete with your results with your friends<br></li><li> Difficulty options: tweak the game difficulty in the Options menu to make it even more challenging<br></li><li> Endless Replayability: With countless combinations of upgrades</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776720/extras/ad8478a4cfd31d7328b15a0589a349ae.poster.avif?t=1730899303\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776720/extras/ad8478a4cfd31d7328b15a0589a349ae.webm?t=1730899303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776720/extras/ad8478a4cfd31d7328b15a0589a349ae.mp4?t=1730899303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "Dream Runner is a time survival game with minimalistic gameplay and roguelite elements. You wake up in a dream world where your memories are vanishing by the second and your main goal is to save as many memories as you can before they vanish forever. All you can do is survive as long as you can before the world inevitably crumbles and you wake up. As you collect memory shards, you level up and on every level up you can get upgrades and bonuses that can completely change your strategy.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776720/extras/0fc2921f80088b040ddaa2c82809b97e.poster.avif?t=1730899303\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776720/extras/0fc2921f80088b040ddaa2c82809b97e.webm?t=1730899303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776720/extras/0fc2921f80088b040ddaa2c82809b97e.mp4?t=1730899303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><u>KEY FEATURES</u></strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Walk, Run, Jump, Dash and other abilities<br></li><li> Combine dozens of different upgrades to create your own strategy<br></li><li> Evade monsters and obstacles<br></li><li> Share and compete with your results with your friends<br></li><li> Difficulty options: tweak the game difficulty in the Options menu to make it even more challenging<br></li><li> Endless Replayability: With countless combinations of upgrades</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776720/extras/ad8478a4cfd31d7328b15a0589a349ae.poster.avif?t=1730899303\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776720/extras/ad8478a4cfd31d7328b15a0589a349ae.webm?t=1730899303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2776720/extras/ad8478a4cfd31d7328b15a0589a349ae.mp4?t=1730899303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "short_description": "You can run, jump and dash, that is all! The goal collect memory shards before they vanish and survive for as long as you can before you run out of floor to run. Here is the catch, every time a memory shard vanish you lose a floor tile. How long can you survive?",
